  "releaseNotes": "Republish of 1.3.0: the 1.3.0 package shipped a stale assembly that did not include ExbilCoreCallbackVerifier. 1.3.1 contains the actual verifier. Signed outbound application callbacks (ES256 / ECDSA-SHA256). ExbilCoreCallbackVerifier helper for receivers to validate the X-ExbilCore-Timestamp / X-ExbilCore-Signature / X-ExbilCore-AppId headers (5-minute anti-replay window). Use 1.3.1; 1.3.0 will be unlisted.",
